  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "At Pei tribe camp, when turtleback myriad wolf king smashes the wall, Pei Yan Fei returns and activates rank four Golden Coat Gu, a second pair of rank four Swallow Wings Gu, and rank four Rainbow Transformation Gu together as the killer move Golden Rainbow Strike. His wings and body turn into a golden halo; he becomes a golden meteor that arcs through the air and pierces turtleback myriad wolf king’s shell, leaving a hole through the beast, then pales as he hovers.",
      "chapters": [
        482
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "fac_pei_tribe",
        "char_pei_yan_fei",
        "gu_golden_coat_gu",
        "gu_swallow_wings_gu",
        "gu_rainbow_transformation_gu",
        "sys_killer_moves"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Against Hao Ji Liu he stakes the same three Gu as his signature move, turns into a golden rainbow, cuts open a waterfall, and hits a Water Image Gu decoy instead of the real body, then pours remaining primeval essence into Swallow Wings Gu and flees.",
      "chapters": [
        525
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "against-hao-ji-liu",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_hao_ji_liu",
        "gu_water_image_gu"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "In the flying bear phantom fight he again grows swallow wings, pairs Golden Coat Gu and Rainbow Transformation Gu, and casts Golden Rainbow Strike, cutting a huge wound across the phantom’s chest from left shoulder to right waist.",
      "chapters": [
        583
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
